# Line endings. Cargo.lock, uv.lock and the formatted Rust sources are
# regenerated by tooling on both Windows and Linux. Pinning these file types to
# LF in the repository stops that from surfacing as whole-file line-ending
# diffs that are indistinguishable from real changes.
#
# Invariant. Do not add a blanket `* text=auto` rule. It changes how every file
# in the repository is normalised and produces a large unrelated diff.

# Rust
*.rs            text eol=lf
Cargo.toml      text eol=lf
Cargo.lock      text eol=lf

# GitHub Actions workflows
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf

# Python
*.py            text eol=lf
pyproject.toml  text eol=lf
uv.lock         text eol=lf

# Markdown
*.md            text eol=lf
